land-guard evidence: refused — spawnSync git ENOBUFS

## fix 1 (dogfood finding)
The gate above refused with `spawnSync git ENOBUFS`: a whole-tree `git ls-files` overflowed the child-process buffer.
The pipe through `tee` hid the exit code, so commit 971fd206 went ahead without a passing gate (the failure this lane
exists to prevent). Fix: `evidence` lists only `docs/validation/<VTID>/` and child processes get a 64 MB buffer.
Regression test: `evidence` on this repository for VTID-05343. From here on the gate runs with no pipe and its exit
code decides.
$ node --test scripts/collab/land-guard.test.mjs
# tests 8
# pass 8
# fail 0
exit=0
